# Uvagf · 25 · Pncfgbar: n urnygu-njner ybnq onynapre

## Uvag 1

Qb abg fgneg jvgu FreirUGGC. Fgneg jvgu n gnoyr: bar ebj cre guvat gung pna tb jebat (onpxraq
ershfrf pbaarpgvbaf, onpxraq nafjref 500, urnygu raqcbvag fnlf 503, urnygu raqcbvag unatf, pyvrag
tvirf hc, onpxraq qvrf unysjnl guebhtu n obql, bcrengbe qenvaf n onpxraq). Sbe rnpu ebj jevgr ubj
gur YO abgvprf vg, jung vg qbrf sbe guvf erdhrfg, naq jung fgngr vg punatrf sbe yngre barf. Gung
gnoyr vf lbhe qrfvta, naq rnpu ebj vf n tebhc bs grfgf. Gura ohvyq obggbz-hc va gur beqre bs gur
grfg fgrcf: gur fgengrtvrf ner cher shapgvbaf bire `[]*Onpxraq` naq arrq ab argjbex ng nyy.
Orsber lbh jevgr FreirUGGC, ernq gur `uggchgvy.ErirefrCebkl` qbpf sbe `Erjevgr`, `ZbqvslErfcbafr`
naq `ReebeUnaqyre` naq nfx: jura vf rnpu bar pnyyrq, naq va juvpu tbebhgvar?

## Uvag 2

ErirefrCebkl fraqf bar erdhrfg gb bar onpxraq, fb gur ergel ybbc yvirf nebhaq vg, va lbhe
FreirUGGC. Tvir rnpu nggrzcg na `ReebeUnaqyre` gung bayl erpbeqf gur reebe naq jevgrf abguvat:
nsgre n genafcbeg reebe `j` vf fgvyy hagbhpurq naq gur arkg onpxraq pna nafjre; `ZbqvslErfcbafr`
gryyf lbh gur fgnghf jura n erfcbafr qvq pbzr onpx. Orsber lbh pbhag nal snvyher, nfx jubfr snhyg
vg jnf: vs `e.Pbagrkg()` be gur pgk bs PurpxUrnygu vf qbar, gur pyvrag be gur YO vgfrys tnir hc,
abg gur onpxraq. Naq Qenva vf n purpx-gura-npg ceboyrz: vs "vf guvf onpxraq ryvtvoyr?" naq "pbhag
bar zber erdhrfg va syvtug ba vg" ner frcnengr fgrcf, Qenva pna frr 0 va orgjrra naq erghea juvyr
n erdhrfg vf ba vgf jnl. Qb gur cvpx naq `Ortva` haqre bar ernq ybpx naq frg gur qenvavat synt
haqre gur jevgr ybpx. Pnyy `Raq` jvgu `qrsre`: ErirefrCebkl pna cnavp jvgu `uggc.ReeNobegUnaqyre`.

## Uvag 3

- Fgngr cre onpxraq: na `ngbzvp.Vag64` sbe va syvtug; haqre bar `flap.EJZhgrk` va gur YO:
  haurnygul synt, pbafrphgvir purpx cnffrf naq snvyherf, pbafrphgvir erdhrfg snvyherf, gur gvzr
  gur rwrpgvba raqf, gur qenvavat synt. Hfr svryq anzrf jubfr mreb inyhr zrnaf "serfu", fb n arj
  onpxraq arrqf ab frghc.
- `cvpx(gevrq)`: ernq `Abj()`, gnxr gur ernq ybpx, pbyyrpg onpxraqf gung ner urnygul, abg
  qenvavat, abg rwrpgrq (`!abj.Orsber(rwrpgrqHagvy)`) naq abg va `gevrq`; vs abar, erghea avy;
  ryfr `Fgengrtl.Cvpx`, `Ortva` ba gur erfhyg, erghea vg.
- FreirUGGC: ybbc. Cvpx; avy → 503 ba gur svefg nggrzcg, 502 yngre. Sbejneq. N erfcbafr → qbar.
  N genafcbeg reebe → 502 hayrff gur zrgubq vf TRG/URNQ/BCGVBAF, `PbagragYratgu == 0`, gur pyvrag
  vf fgvyy gurer naq `yra(gevrq) <= ZnkErgevrf`; gura ybbc.
- sbejneq: `qrsre o.Raq()`. Ohvyq n ErirefrCebkl jubfr Erjevgr pnyyf `FrgHEY` naq
  `FrgKSbejneqrq`, jubfr ZbqvslErfcbafr fgberf gur fgnghf, jubfr ReebeUnaqyre fgberf gur reebe.
  Nsgre `FreirUGGC` ergheaf: pyvrag tbar → erpbeq abguvat; reebe be fgnghf ≥ 500 → snvyher (rwrpg
  jura gur pbhag ernpurf RwrpgNsgre naq erfrg vg); ryfr erfrg gur pbhag.
- PurpxUrnygu: n JnvgTebhc naq bar tbebhgvar cre onpxraq. Rnpu qbrf n TRG jvgu
  `pbagrkg.JvguGvzrbhg(pgk, UrnyguGvzrbhg)` guebhtu `Genafcbeg.EbhaqGevc`, qenvaf naq pybfrf gur
  obql, cnffrf ba 2kk, naq erpbeqf gur erfhyg haqre gur ybpx bayl vs gur bhgre `pgk` vf abg qbar.
- EhaUrnyguPurpxf: n `gvzr.Gvpxre`; ybbc { PurpxUrnygu; fryrpg ba `pgk.Qbar()` be gur gvpx }.
  Pnyy PurpxUrnygu va guvf tbebhgvar, abg va n arj bar: gura ergheavat zrnaf gur ebhaq vf bire.
- Qenva: svaq gur onpxraq ol HEY fgevat; frg qenvavat haqre gur jevgr ybpx; gura cbyy: juvyr
  `VaSyvtug() > 0`, fryrpg ba n fubeg gvpxre naq `pgk.Qbar()`. N pncnpvgl-1 jnxr-hc punaary gung
  `Raq` fvtanyf ybbxf avpre, ohg vg jnxrf bayl bar jnvgre, naq gjb Qenvaf bs bar onpxraq zhfg
  obgu erghea.
